.env
compose.override.yaml
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# NOTE: data/ is deliberately NOT ignored. meta.json is the curated page
# figures and recessions.json the vendored shared dataset. Machine-owned
# artefacts are listed individually instead.
data/*.tmp
# Rewritten wholesale every run; tracking it would bury every real edit.
data/series.json
data/updater-state.json

# Playwright MCP scratch output: screenshots and page snapshots taken while
# checking the rendered page. Working notes, never repo content.
.playwright-mcp/
